<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 24.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 24.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday, June 24:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,687.80 (1,693.20)	CHF  1,176.20 (1,176.30)</p>
<p>    DEM    979.29 (980.32)	  GBP  2,801.10 (2,796.80)</p>
<p>    ATS    139.18 (139.35)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $13.24 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$ 8.73 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $21.97 million ($16.26 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
